{"t":"Nightmare Isles Mini World Change","s":"nightmare-isles-mini-world-change-f9840","k":"quest","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Nightmare Isles Mini World Change</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(250 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Mini World Change</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10.80<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 21, 2015<br/>Summer Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This quest has no legend.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Nightmare%20Isles\">Nightmare Isles</a> (via <a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27labal\">Kha'labal</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Devourer%20%28Geography%29\">Devourer</a>)\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Silencer\">Silencer</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Retching%20Horror\">Retching Horror</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Choking%20Fear\">Choking Fear</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Terrorsleep\">Terrorsleep</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>Ability to obtain a <a href=\"#/wiki/Nightmare%20Teddy\">Nightmare Teddy</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Messages\">Messages</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Nightmare_River\">Nightmare River</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20World%20Board\">World Board</a>: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">A sandstorm travels through Darama, leading to isles full of deadly creatures inside a nightmare. Avoid the river near Drefia!</span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Towncryer\">Towncryer</a>: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">Near Drefia's mountains, a storm has revealed the entry to a nightmare that can't be sealed. Horrible creatures there spell instant death to all young adventurers who dare take a breath!</span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Nightmare_Coast\">Nightmare Coast</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20World%20Board\">World Board</a>: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">A sandstorm travels through Darama, leading to isles full of deadly creatures inside a nightmare. Avoid the northernmost coast!</span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Towncryer\">Towncryer</a>: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">Near Darashia's coast, a storm has revealed the entry to a nightmare that can't be sealed. Horrible creatures there spell instant death to all young adventurers who dare take a breath!</span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Nightmare_in_the_Tar_Pits\">Nightmare in the Tar Pits</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20World%20Board\">World Board</a>: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">A sandstorm travels through Darama, leading to isles full of deadly creatures inside a nightmare. Avoid the Ankrahmun tar pits!</span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Towncryer\">Towncryer</a>: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">In Ankrahmun's desert, a storm has revealed the entry to a nightmare that can't be sealed. Horrible creatures there spell instant death to all young adventurers who dare take a breath!</span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<p>This MWC is active every day and features a teleporter which leads to the dreaded <a href=\"#/wiki/Nightmare%20Isles\">Nightmare Isles</a>. The teleporter can be located:\n</p>\n<ul><li>near the <a href=\"#/wiki/Plague%20Spike\">Plague Spike</a> (<i>river near Drefia/Drefia's mountains</i>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33037,32404,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33037, 32404, 7)</a>)</li>\n<li>in northern <a href=\"#/wiki/Devourer%20%28Geography%29\">Devourer</a> (<i>northernmost coast/Darashia's coast</i>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33216,32273,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33216, 32273, 7)</a>)</li>\n<li>or in <a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27labal\">Kha'labal</a> (<i>Ankrahmun tar pits/Ankrahmun's desert</i>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33265,32653,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33265, 32653, 7)</a>).</li></ul>\n<p>On these isles, fearsome creatures protecting a <a href=\"#/wiki/Nightmare%20Teddy\">Nightmare Teddy</a> lurk. Do not access them unprepared.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["nightmare-teddy-quest"]}